2026-10-20T01:08:12.9642094Z -- v4.0.3 — stale-plan guards, billed peaks, boundary clamps
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9642324Z   ok   a skew within one step length clamps to the FIRST step, not the last
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9642515Z   ok   beyond one step the plan says nothing about now: idle
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9642747Z   ok   the pre-horizon idle IS the empty-plan fallback, one shared dict
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9642936Z   ok   past the horizon the last step still answers, unchanged
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9643114Z   ok   before any solve the plan has no age and is not stale
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9643327Z   ok   three consecutive failed solves raise exactly one repair issue
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9643534Z   ok   the issue carries its translation key and placeholders
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9643711Z   ok   an hour-old plan is not yet stale (90-minute floor)
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9643864Z   ok   past three missed cycles the plan is stale
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9644055Z   ok   the threshold scales with the configured update interval
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9644203Z   ok   a stale plan's schedule step is not applied
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9644348Z   ok   a fresh plan actuates exactly as before
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9644532Z   ok   fixed-rule modes carry no horizon and ignore staleness
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9644711Z   ok   new snapshots no longer carry the peak tracker at all
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9644906Z   ok   a learner rollback leaves the month's realised peaks alone
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9645094Z   ok   an old snapshot still carrying the key is simply ignored
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9645318Z   ok   from_config clamps zero and negative masses to the physical floor
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9645489Z   ok   direct construction runs through the same clamp
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9645717Z   ok   the service-write chokepoint re-clamps after attribute assignment
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9645874Z   ok   no sane configuration ever subdivides a step
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9646045Z   ok   the stiff case genuinely exercises the subdivision
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9646243Z   ok   a 24 h trajectory on the stiff house stays finite and bounded
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9646391Z   ok   a legacy naive last_fed loads as aware UTC
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9646562Z   ok   and release_if_starved subtracts it without raising
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9646716Z   ok   a fresh humidity reading feeds the mold floor
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9647012Z   ok   a frozen humidity sensor reads as no reading — the mold floor vanishes
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9647255Z   ok   a live inlet probe still wins
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9647457Z   ok   a probe frozen for two days degrades to the seasonal model
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9647677Z   ok   an unreachable Tibber is a connectivity verdict, not an auth one
