2026-10-20T01:08:12.9648145Z -- v4.0.4 — DST-day exclusion from price learning
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9648330Z   ok   a Fri-Mon wrap covers Friday through Monday, inclusive
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9648529Z   ok   Saturday, Sunday and Monday are all inside a Fri-Mon wrap
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9648658Z   ok   Tuesday is outside a Fri-Mon wrap
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9648788Z   ok   a Fri-Mon wrap is not silently empty
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9648971Z   ok   the synthetic fold day really carries 25 hourly entries
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9649122Z   ok   a plain 24-hour day trains the hourly shape
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9649593Z   ok   the 25-hour autumn fold day is excluded — its collapse used to pass the 24-hour gate with a fabricated hour 2
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9649791Z   ok   the 23-hour spring gap day is excluded by the same predicate
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9650027Z   ok   quarter learning sees the same exclusion: plain day in, fold day out
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9650233Z   ok   naive timestamps carry one offset (None) and keep learning
