2026-10-20T01:08:12.9650438Z -- v4.0.4 — negative-mean initial guess
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9650651Z   ok   a positive-mean horizon gets the historical formula bit for bit
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9650892Z   ok   all-negative prices: the cheapest (most negative) step starts highest
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9651118Z   ok   and the guess is monotone in price rank, inside the same 0.2-1.0 band
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9651294Z   ok   the un-guarded formula really did invert on this input
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9651524Z   ok   a near-zero mean takes the rank path instead of saturating the clip
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9651759Z   ok   sun entirely past the solve horizon moves no warm-start weight (#933)
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9651970Z   ok   the same sun inside the horizon does discount (#933 null control)
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9652152Z   ok   a zero-step lookahead leaves every weight at one (#933)
