2026-10-20T01:08:12.9791836Z   ok   the terminal credit repays a stored buffer kWh at the flow-derated COP the simulation charged to store it, less what the tank loses first
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9792071Z   ok   and at -5 C that haircut is small: winter storage is not discouraged
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9792292Z   ok   which is genuinely dearer than the plain curve the old code paid
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9792467Z   ok   building-mass deficits keep the plain conversion
