2026-10-20T01:08:12.9794100Z   ok   and it moves with the learned split, like the dynamics it settles
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9794269Z   ok   single-zone keeps the historical formula exactly
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9794537Z   ok   a strong pump's cap is the rating — mild installs are untouched
