2026-10-20T01:08:12.9914246Z   ok   the inferred estimator reads a real defrost as a PERFECT interval
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9914502Z   ok   an over-1 ratio can no longer park the derate above 1.0
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9914744Z   ok   five defrosting minutes in thirty is a duty of 1/6
