2026-10-20T01:08:12.9916589Z   ok   the derate is 1 - duty x the loss multiplier
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9916821Z   ok   more duty is always a deeper derate, never a shallower one
2026-10-20T01:08:12.9917100Z   ok   and it is bounded below, so a latched flag cannot zero the pump
