2026-10-20T01:08:13.0032385Z -- #369/#370/#1738 — the duplication window can fire, and --record refuses a laundered regression
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0032641Z   ok   a copy in ANOTHER module is one copy, whatever its locals are called (#1738 a)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0032848Z   ok   a third copy costs one more, not two more: copies, not pairs
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0033098Z   ok   a re-wrap or a comment moves nothing: the window is the AST, not the lines
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0033309Z   ok   the node floor holds: two short shared statements are not a copy
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0033520Z   ok   the shipped window is 2 statements of at least 30 nodes (#1738)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0033777Z   ok   regression_rows names the metric that moved the wrong way, old and new (#370)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0034040Z   ok   cross_seam_edges moving up IS a regression row: the retired ratio's band is gone
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0034290Z   ok   --record REFUSES a worsened metric by default and leaves the table untouched
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0034555Z   ok   an explicit --allow-regression reason lets it through and writes the new value
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0034804Z   ok   a blank reason is refused, so the flag cannot decay into pasted boilerplate
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0035081Z   ok   a pure tightening still records with no flag -- that is the point of the exercise
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0035316Z   ok   and the path that proceeds still stamps a resolvable recorded_at (#363)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0035550Z   ok   cross_seam_edges is recorded like every other row -- a tightening lands
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0035787Z   ok   --allow-regression is a flag that demands a reason, not a bare switch
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0035794Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0036138Z -- #350/#374 — an improvement must be recorded, and the worst method has a budget
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0036398Z   ok   improvement_rows names every metric with headroom, budget and measured (#350)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0036649Z   ok   and is the exact mirror of regression_rows: a worsening is not an improvement
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0036840Z   ok   a level metric is neither an improvement nor a regression
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0037083Z   ok   no metric is exempt from the ratchet: the two retired categories are gone
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0037490Z   ok   improvement_rows names cross_seam_edges like any other row when it falls
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0037964Z   ok   the ratchet FAILS on an improvement instead of printing a note (#350)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0038236Z   ok   and the improvement block names all three, so the author knows what to write down
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0038436Z   ok   and prints the exact runnable command, not just the numbers
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0038653Z   ok   and frames it as 'you made this better, write it down', not as a breach
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0038932Z   ok   a zero-headroom tree still passes silently -- eleven of the last eighteen commits
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0039089Z   ok   a worsening still fails, and still as a breach
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0039356Z   ok   headroom on cross_seam_edges alone is an unrecorded improvement, so the run fails
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0039581Z   ok   an unrecorded improvement is not a violation at the exit code (#808)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0039878Z   ok   with a breach in the same diff the improvement is still named but --record is not offered
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0040145Z   ok   table_maxima reports the worst row of each table measure() already sorts (#374)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0040393Z   ok   and it is a MAX, not the first row -- an unsorted table still reports the worst
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0040632Z   ok   an empty table reads 0, which tightens the gate rather than opening a hole
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0040801Z   ok   and measure() wires both budget keys to it (#374)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0041040Z   ok   both are plain counts, so the existing current > budget arm handles them
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0041321Z   ok   one extra `and` clause inside a function costs exactly 1 of CC -- the vector, priced
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0041552Z   ok   and print_report prints both, so the evidence and the RESULT line agree
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0041823Z   ok   sum_cc is rejected IN THE CODE, with the reason and the issue it would break (#374)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0042078Z   ok   the dead-member census exempts the names HA looks up on an instance (#1395)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0042364Z   ok   a @property nothing reads is a dead member; one a live member reads is not (D7-s3-02)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0042630Z   ok   and measure() carries the count and print_report prints an evidence line (#1395)
