2026-10-20T01:08:13.0180722Z   ok   the captured inputs carry the state and the plan's own assumptions
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0180941Z   ok   a weather source that raises costs the wind, not the whole capture
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0181130Z   ok   the captured electrical power is the SPACE channel only
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0181370Z   ok   a legible flag feeds the MEASURED estimator and the inference not at all
2026-10-20T01:08:13.0181600Z   ok   a window far from the interval length is a restart, not a measurement
