2026-10-20T01:08:13.1593340Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1593471Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1593632Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1593822Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1593948Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594043Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594135Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594505Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594632Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594748Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594871Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1594996Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595003Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595108Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595228Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595359Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595472Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595626Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595739Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1595875Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596001Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596148Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596327Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596515Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596523Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596633Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596796Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1596938Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597060Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597297Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597305Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597439Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597605Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597746Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597866Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1597989Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1598132Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1598355Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1598513Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1598650Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1598657Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1598841Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1599070Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1599269Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1599519Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1599526Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1599785Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1600033Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1600247Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1600527Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1600753Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1600929Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1600936Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1601159Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1601394Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1601561Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1601712Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1601861Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1601871Z 
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1602055Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1602209Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1602327Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1602672Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1602883Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603029Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603155Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603295Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603504Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603642Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603773Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1603972Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1604221Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1604407Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1604603Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1604837Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1605011Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1605222Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1605439Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1605637Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1605811Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1606055Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1606290Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1606547Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1606712Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1606947Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1607372Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1607579Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1607825Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1608077Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1608313Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1608533Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1608786Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1608795Z 
