2026-10-20T01:08:13.1609196Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1609346Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1609537Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1609704Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-20T01:08:13.1609873Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
